      "source": "https://www.tshaonline.org/handbook/entries/montalba-tx",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Montalba nestles in the shadow of a mountain, giving it a distinctive high‑land feel.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
